    per turn. During your Main Phase: You can place 1 "Elfnote" Continuous Spell
    from your Deck face-up on your field. During your opponent''s turn (Quick Effect):
    You can switch the locations of this card in your Main Monster Zone and the monster
    in your center Main Monster Zone, then you can banish (face-up) 1 random card
    from your opponent''s hand, until the End Phase.'
